io: built at the default size, 4 and 7
echo: stdout is stdin's lines, each without the "\r\n" or "\n" that ends it, at the default size
echo: no input, no line, at the default size
size 4: echo, write and crash print what the default size prints, with the same exit status
size 7: echo, write and crash print what the default size prints, with the same exit status
